
NumPy

This folder contains my NumPy learning and practice notebooks as part of my journey toward becoming a Data Scientist.

Contents
Session 13 — NumPy Fundamentals

session13_numpy_fundamentals.ipynb

Covers the fundamentals of NumPy, including:

NumPy arrays
Array creation
Array attributes
Indexing and slicing
Array operations
Basic mathematical operations
Reshaping arrays
Session 14 — NumPy Advanced

session14_numpy_advanced.ipynb

Covers advanced NumPy concepts, including:

Advanced indexing
Broadcasting
Array manipulation
Mathematical and statistical functions
Working with multidimensional arrays
Vectorized operations
Session 15 — NumPy Practice

session_15_practice_numpy_3.ipynb

Contains hands-on practice questions and exercises to strengthen NumPy concepts learned in previous sessions.

